# No data dumps in git

GitHub is for **code**. Do not add or commit:

- `data/official/` dumps (`*.jsonl`, `bundle/`, `archive/`, zips)
- `data/external/` Hugging Face / Zenodo blobs
- `models/pretrained/**`, `*.pt` / `*.bin` / `*.safetensors`
- `checkpoints/`, `outputs/` (except `.gitkeep`)
- `mlflow.db`, `mlruns/`, `mlartifacts/`
- `.venv/`, Hugging Face caches

Keep README / CATALOG / `.gitkeep` / `dvc.yaml` / `dvc.lock`. If `git status` shows a dataset or weight, fix `.gitignore` instead of adding it.
